; one variable: a themed state StyleBox on a CheckBox and a CheckButton, which Button draws under the label and
; whose `normal` margins place the check (button.cpp:214-218, check_box.cpp:126-131, check_button.cpp:132-138).
; No other scene gives the check family a StyleBox, so none shows a regression in it.

